{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03649",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.13,
      "end_seconds": 6.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "Well, hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.36,
      "end_seconds": 11.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.35,
      "end_seconds": 25.51,
      "duration_seconds": 13.16,
      "text": "Um, uh, I've been dealing with my right leg suddenly giving way. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.68,
      "end_seconds": 30.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.51,
      "end_seconds": 38.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "I mean, um, I'm on Eltroxin, every morning for my thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.83,
      "end_seconds": 43.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.85,
      "end_seconds": 50.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "100 micrograms, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.31,
      "end_seconds": 53.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "When did you start it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.89,
      "end_seconds": 60.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "About nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.59,
      "end_seconds": 76.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.97,
      "text": "Alright, how many days or weeks has it been? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.55,
      "end_seconds": 103.35,
      "duration_seconds": 24.8,
      "text": "It's been about four days, I'm fairly sure. Oh, and tingling. That's been about the same, three weeks. With tingling, I'd say a few times a day. Oh, and being very stressed. About being very stressed, I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.29,
      "end_seconds": 109.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "And what about back pain or loss of bladder control?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.44,
      "end_seconds": 116.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.29,
      "text": "I haven't had back pain or loss of bladder control, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.68,
      "end_seconds": 122.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any headache or visual loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.9,
      "end_seconds": 126.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Ah, nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.59,
      "end_seconds": 131.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Okay, how are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.59,
      "end_seconds": 134.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.81,
      "end_seconds": 138.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.92,
      "end_seconds": 144.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.9,
      "end_seconds": 159.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.06,
      "end_seconds": 166.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "I have an underactive thyroid, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.92,
      "end_seconds": 175.01,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "Alright, an underactive thyroid, that matches what I have here. Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.88,
      "end_seconds": 183.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.53,
      "text": "Yes, I had a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation, five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.46,
      "end_seconds": 187.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.14,
      "end_seconds": 200.73,
      "duration_seconds": 12.59,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.66,
      "end_seconds": 205.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.3,
      "end_seconds": 207.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.77,
      "end_seconds": 213.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.1,
      "end_seconds": 217.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "My grandmother had dementia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.35,
      "end_seconds": 221.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.77,
      "end_seconds": 236.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.43,
      "end_seconds": 268.24,
      "duration_seconds": 10.81,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 37.0 degrees, respiratory rate 14, heart rate 83, BP is 116 over 77, SpO2 99 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.33,
      "end_seconds": 274.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.31,
      "end_seconds": 288.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.8,
      "end_seconds": 291.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.91,
      "end_seconds": 311.04,
      "duration_seconds": 8.13,
      "text": "The leg gives way on testing but the strength returns when you are distracted, and the reflexes are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.37,
      "end_seconds": 324.72,
      "duration_seconds": 11.35,
      "text": "You can sit up now. So where does that leave us? This is probably a likely functional neurological disorder. A spinal problem is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.7,
      "end_seconds": 330.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.23,
      "end_seconds": 348.39,
      "duration_seconds": 17.16,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a likely functional neurological disorder, and we'll know more once the an MRI scan is back. I'm sending you for an MRI scan because of leg weakness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 348.96,
      "end_seconds": 353.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "We have a slot Wednesday at 11:30 am, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.88,
      "end_seconds": 384.82,
      "duration_seconds": 29.94,
      "text": "I think blood tests makes sense here, for neurological symptoms. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. This is real and treatable, the nervous system is working differently, not damaged. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. I'd like to see you again after the scan. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 389.73,
      "end_seconds": 393.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}